{"unit_id":"SeverusZh__dsh-skills-mcp-group-manager#feature-skill-groups","repo":"SeverusZh/dsh-skills-mcp-group-manager","commit":"0bf51722c4a10325c2ae6b1ede2381ed885ab8e4","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Skills & MCPs Group Manager 的功能「技能组管理」：创建、重命名、启用或删除技能组，并将技能加入或移出分组。通过面板或 manager_groups_* 工具操作，变更保存到状态文件并刷新技能目录。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:352-444","lib/index.js:647-778"]}
